{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">內地機械人企業宇樹科技，公開一款可以透過人工智能(AI)大模型，進行自主格鬥的機械人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ROBOT-1130_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026MRj1J1UWMs1788843162.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.ROBOT-1130_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">宇樹科技上載片段，見到一台人形機械人與一名真人持續對戰，期間它能自主感知並預測對手招式，及碰撞後情況，並規劃自己的應對動作，令自己不會失去平衡，也能防禦反擊，全程不需要人進行遙控。宇樹科技稱，技術突破過去瓶頸，提升機械人的效能。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T05:18:00.939225+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}